<title>CHILE: Airline Lan Chile to increase capital.</title>
<headline>Airline Lan Chile to increase capital.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's largest airline Lan Chile plans to increase its capital by $70 million, the company said in a statement filed at the Stocks and Values Superintendency.</p>
<p>Shareholders will vote on the increase at a meeting on April 22, said the statement.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
